    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLOUDBREAKER</strong> - <i>Devil May Cry</i> meets <i>Ace Combat</i>. a high speed Acelike Roguelike with <i><strong>SSSTYLE</strong></i>. Cut across cel-shaded, action-packed, arcade-paced dogfights as you fly, fight, and upgrade your roster of kickass planes. Every battle is massive, every location is procedural, and every fight is a spectacle - whether its aircraft, blimps, dragons or mechs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be <strong>STYLISH</strong>, be a SPECTACLE, be an ACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/7a7653018c9c07b6d8040a4241600983.poster.avif?t=1753021646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/7a7653018c9c07b6d8040a4241600983.webm?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/7a7653018c9c07b6d8040a4241600983.mp4?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave, destroy, dodge, and parry everything that comes your way. Earn style points and <strong>enhance your style ranking</strong> by flying like a true ace. The stage is all yours, show the enemy your moves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE THE <strong>ARSENAL</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use missiles, machine guns, lasers, orbital strikes, electric bolts, shotguns, slashing attacks, bouncing railguns, cluster missiles and more!</strong> Limited ammo is for chumps! Fire at will, but make sure you don't overheat, overwhelm, or overload yourself as you fight! Equip up to three special weapons at once and go ham!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DIFFERENT SKY EACH TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/95c61a7864d81d4a5baddd1755569588.poster.avif?t=1753021646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/95c61a7864d81d4a5baddd1755569588.webm?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/95c61a7864d81d4a5baddd1755569588.mp4?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is <strong>procedurally generated</strong> and no two fights are alike: <strong>Weather changes, cloud cover variation, terrain anomalies</strong>, and random map events among <strong>4 distinct environmental zones</strong> change the battlefield each time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURN THROUGH THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cfea71c34d0f07af000c772d4248c78c.poster.avif?t=1753021646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cfea71c34d0f07af000c772d4248c78c.webm?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cfea71c34d0f07af000c772d4248c78c.mp4?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sharp turns &amp; aggressive plays by <strong>Drifting</strong>, because angle of attack is just a suggestion to you. <strong>Boost</strong> forward and cut through clouds, leaving everything in the dust. No, it's not your plane. <strong>You are just built different.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE YOUR DELIVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the Courier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission? <strong>Deliver the package.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The destination? Right in the middle of an all-out warzone, where elite fighter squadrons from across the globe swarm the sky all united for the noble goal of glory and peace... <strong>with only you to get in their way, again and again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing and burning is just a temporary inconvenience for you, however: Warp tech will pull you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No matter how far you fly, no matter how long it takes, no matter how many elite pilots they send after you, nothing will stop you from finishing your goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The delivery WILL be completed. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Hopefully before it gets cold!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural maps with plenty of random alterations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large variety of weaponry, upgrades, gear, and aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach skills to either your engineer or yourself to aid in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct zones with unique environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style meter</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLOUDBREAKER</strong> - <i>Devil May Cry</i> meets <i>Ace Combat</i>. a high speed Acelike Roguelike with <i><strong>SSSTYLE</strong></i>. Cut across cel-shaded, action-packed, arcade-paced dogfights as you fly, fight, and upgrade your roster of kickass planes. Every battle is massive, every location is procedural, and every fight is a spectacle - whether its aircraft, blimps, dragons or mechs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be <strong>STYLISH</strong>, be a SPECTACLE, be an ACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/7a7653018c9c07b6d8040a4241600983.poster.avif?t=1753021646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/7a7653018c9c07b6d8040a4241600983.webm?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/7a7653018c9c07b6d8040a4241600983.mp4?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave, destroy, dodge, and parry everything that comes your way. Earn style points and <strong>enhance your style ranking</strong> by flying like a true ace. The stage is all yours, show the enemy your moves!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE THE <strong>ARSENAL</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use missiles, machine guns, lasers, orbital strikes, electric bolts, shotguns, slashing attacks, bouncing railguns, cluster missiles and more!</strong> Limited ammo is for chumps! Fire at will, but make sure you don't overheat, overwhelm, or overload yourself as you fight! Equip up to three special weapons at once and go ham!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DIFFERENT SKY EACH TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/95c61a7864d81d4a5baddd1755569588.poster.avif?t=1753021646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/95c61a7864d81d4a5baddd1755569588.webm?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/95c61a7864d81d4a5baddd1755569588.mp4?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is <strong>procedurally generated</strong> and no two fights are alike: <strong>Weather changes, cloud cover variation, terrain anomalies</strong>, and random map events among <strong>4 distinct environmental zones</strong> change the battlefield each time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BURN THROUGH THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cfea71c34d0f07af000c772d4248c78c.poster.avif?t=1753021646\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cfea71c34d0f07af000c772d4248c78c.webm?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639060/extras/cfea71c34d0f07af000c772d4248c78c.mp4?t=1753021646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sharp turns &amp; aggressive plays by <strong>Drifting</strong>, because angle of attack is just a suggestion to you. <strong>Boost</strong> forward and cut through clouds, leaving everything in the dust. No, it's not your plane. <strong>You are just built different.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE YOUR DELIVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're the Courier.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission? <strong>Deliver the package.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The destination? Right in the middle of an all-out warzone, where elite fighter squadrons from across the globe swarm the sky all united for the noble goal of glory and peace... <strong>with only you to get in their way, again and again and again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing and burning is just a temporary inconvenience for you, however: Warp tech will pull you back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No matter how far you fly, no matter how long it takes, no matter how many elite pilots they send after you, nothing will stop you from finishing your goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The delivery WILL be completed. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Hopefully before it gets cold!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural maps with plenty of random alterations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large variety of weaponry, upgrades, gear, and aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach skills to either your engineer or yourself to aid in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct zones with unique environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style meter</p></li></ul>",
